{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんとひなちまがWキャストで出演してる舞台"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「【最終章】學蘭歌劇『帝一の國』―血戦のラストダンス―」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のゲネ観てきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/18/8693437/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回 観に行ってるけど\n今回も行かせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回思うけど\nさゆにゃんの美美子ちゃんの可愛さね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/18/8693437/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、改めて思ったけど\nさゆにゃんの声が大好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んで、これも毎回思うんだけど\n今度ひなちまのも見たいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白いし世界観も好きだから\n最終章って言われると寂しく感じる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/18/8693437/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人とも大千秋楽まで頑張れ～！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/18/8693437/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/18/8693437/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『GREEN GORA』\n今回も出させていただいてます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連載2回目なんですけど\nまたたくさんページ数をいただけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いゴルフウェアも着れて\n本当に嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/18/8693437/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は\nちーちゃん、伊織、中田の3人だよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も対決しちゃってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/18/8693437/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回、ドラコン対決で負けちゃいましたが\n対決内容違いますよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰が勝つかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当ててね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/18/8693437/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はアンダーライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんの卒コンです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで\n楽しもうね！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}